## Architecture

- Functional approach: pure functions, frozen dataclasses
- Layers: CLI → Domain → Infrastructure
- Config loaded once, passed as frozen dataclass

## Commands

- `task test` — lint + typecheck + pytest
- `task app -- <args>` — run the app

## Hard rules

- No classes for logic (only frozen dataclasses for data)
- No `subprocess` outside `infrastructure/`
- No `os.getenv()` outside `config.py`
- All dataclasses are `frozen=True`
- Python {{ python_version }}+, type hints on every function
